cription":"Echoes of Mystralia is an action-heavy spellcrafting ARPG roguelite, where rapid combat meets deep customization. Craft your own spells, unlock new combinations, fight epic bosses, and discover a narrative-rich world that never plays the same twice.","detailedDescription":"Echoes of Mystralia is a roguelite action-RPG where memory is power. Craft your own spells, refine your tactics, and carve your path through a world trapped in the horrors of its past.\n\nPlay as Mazarim, a Watcher tasked with protecting the Cycle of Memories. Explore the lands of Mystralia, meet its lost souls, and face the Shadows of the Past. Will you save the World’s Memory before it disappears into the Rift?\n\nCRAFT YOUR PLAYSTYLE \n\nThunderbursts, freezing tornadoes, fire vortices. If you can imagine it, you can craft it. Memories are your only weapon against the Shadows of the Past. Combine them, reorder them, and watch your spell take shape right in front of you.\n\nCHOOSE YOUR PATH\n\nDiscover a world haunted by its past, where people are reliving the horrors of their own history. Every path has its challenges, its encounters, and its rewards. And your journey is yours to command.\n\nFORGE YOUR INNER STRENGTH \n\nEvery journey ends with a return to the Azimuth Temple. Up there, Watchers can develop their skills, change their combat approach, or simply enjoy the pearls of wisdom of a millennia-old dragon.\n\nLEAD A MYSTICAL QUEST\n\nA Rift has opened in the Cycle of Memories. As a Watcher, it falls to you to save the World’s Memory. Divinities, primordial Guardians, and peoples scarred by war and exploitation: a vast world unfolds before you. Only you can uncover its hidden truths.\n\nJOIN OUR COMMUNITY, IMPACT THE GAME DEVELOPMENT\n\nWe invite you to join our community hub on Discord to follow game development: be part of our private playtests, engage with other players and enter the magical world of Mystralia!","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/3a5b2fb27541d05ab9135b59b51ae77da87e5aed/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1791468138"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/3ba15e41de869d3938d4d4ba6c36ff380c906c07/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1791468138"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/85a54f49d467d8da3b99aab50798b7385f5ba291/ss_85a54f49d467d8da3b99aab50798b7385f5ba291.600x338.jpg?t=1791468138","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/85a54f49d467d8da3b99aab50798b7385f5ba291/ss_85a54f49d467d8da3b99aab50798b7385f5ba291.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791468138"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/1bb71680e701b43fa7fe9790bff10d994f6450bf/ss_1bb71680e701b43fa7fe9790bff10d994f6450bf.600x338.jpg?t=1791468138","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/1bb71680e701b43fa7fe9790bff10d994f6450bf/ss_1bb71680e701b43fa7fe9790bff10d994f6450bf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791468138"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/d5a21b4ee2718a50f31e48d06e520f0d3181c838/ss_d5a21b4ee2718a50f31e48d06e520f0d3181c838.600x338.jpg?t=1791468138","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/d5a21b4ee2718a50f31e48d06e520f0d3181c838/ss_d5a21b4ee2718a50f31e48d06e520f0d3181c838.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791468138"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/dff0617409ab653c8f1a76a41b127ae4d6c9e5ad/ss_dff0617409ab653c8f1a76a41b127ae4d6c9e5ad.600x338.jpg?t=1791468138","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/974480/dff0617409ab653c8f1a7